      "content": "SP 80 SE              THE LEE                 THE LEE                                               (south side) 4/96                                          Barn 70 metres north                                               of Church Farmhouse - GV                                            II Barn.  Early C18.  Timber framed and weatherboarded.  Old tile roof. Part of south-west wall in C18 brick.  Five bays.  Gabled central wagon porch to north east elevation.  Half-hipped roof.  Curved principal roof trusses with collars.  Tiebeam and purlin braces. Listing NGR: SP8973204465"
